<title>INDIA: India's Lakshmi Machine 96/97 net falls.</title>
<headline>India's Lakshmi Machine 96/97 net falls.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-05-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to March 31, 1997</p>
<p>	     (in million rupees unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit		237.8  vs     429.6</p>
<p>    Turnover		5,389.3  vs   5,999.6</p>
<p>    Div (in percent)	 60.0  vs	60.0</p>
<p>    Other income	    139.7  vs     188.4</p>
<p>    Total expenditure   4,420.5  vs   5,100.1</p>
<p>    Interest costs	   83.2  vs	44.6</p>
<p>    Depreciation	    617.5  vs     518.6</p>
<p>    Tax			 170.0  vs	95.0</p>
<p>Note: Textile equipment maker Lakshmi Machine Works said it would offer one bonus equity share for every one held.</p>
<p>-- Bombay equities desk +91-22-265 9000</p>
</text>
